{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1477","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"运：运转，转动。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%80%B5","sourceUrl":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%80%B5","text":"怵","type":"link"},{"text":"惕：惊骇，恐惧。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"内：同“纳”，交结。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"要：博取名誉，要，求取。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"同乡。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"非恶其声而然：并非因为厌恶孩子的哭声才这样。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"羞恶wu4：对自身的不善感到羞耻，对他人的不善感到憎恶。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"谦逊推让。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"萌芽，发端。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"四肢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"伤害。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"同“燃”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"流通，指泉水涌出。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"安定。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9963-14"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"孟子曰：“人皆有不忍人之心。先王有不忍人之心，斯有不忍人之政矣； 以不忍人之心行不忍人之政，治天下可运","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-9963-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之掌上。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"所以谓人皆有不忍人之心者：今人乍见孺子将入于井，皆有怵惕","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-9963-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"恻隐之心；非所以内交","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-9963-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"于孺子之父母也，非所以要誉","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-9963-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"于乡党","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-9963-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"朋友也，非恶其声而然","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-9963-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"由是观之，无恻隐之心，非人也；无羞恶","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-9963-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之心，非人也；无辞让","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-9963-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之心，非人也；无是非之心，非人也。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"恻隐之心，仁之端","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-9963-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也；羞恶之心，义之端也；辞让之心，礼之端也；是非之心，智之端也。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"人之有是四端也，犹其有四体","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-9963-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。有是四端而自谓不能者，自贼","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-9963-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"者也；谓其君不能者，贼其君者也。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"凡有四端于我者，知皆扩而充之矣，若火之始然","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-9963-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，泉之始达","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-9963-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。苟能充之，足以保","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-9963-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"四海；苟不充之，不足以事父母。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"孟子曰：「人皆有所不忍，達之於其所忍，仁也；人皆有所不為，達之於其所為，義也。人能充無欲害人之心，而仁不可勝用也；人能充無穿踰之心，而義不可勝用也。人能充無受爾汝之實，無所往而不為義也。士未可以言而言，是以言餂之也；可以言而不言，是以不言餂之也，是皆穿踰之類也。」","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"先秦儒家所讲的大都是人生的基本道理，今天看来仍有一定的启发意义。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本课所选《论语》十二章，焦点在立身处世的规范性原则，深入浅出，要言不烦，精辟隽永。学习时要在理解仁、义、礼等儒家思想核心概念的基础上，重点分析孔子关于“君子”之德及修身养性的基本观点。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《大学之道》强调“修身为本”，提纲挈领地论说“三纲”“八目”的体系。“三纲”即“明明德”“亲民”“止于至善”，“八目”即“格物”“致知”“诚意”“正心”“修身”“齐家”“治国”“平天下”。学习时要结合《大学》中的相关论述，理解“三纲”“八目”的具体所指及其内部关联。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《人皆有不忍人之心》以人突然看见小孩子将要掉入井里时的反应为依据，论证“人皆有不忍人之心”，由此提出人都有“四端”，进而论述“四端”对为人处世、治理天下的重要性。学习时注意结合自身经验和现实生活，探究孟子这些论断是否有充分的合理性。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"研习中，注意这些经典篇章在论述道理方面的巧妙之处，如善用譬喻、对比，思路简洁明晰等；结合自己所了解的历史文化知识，思考先秦儒家的思想智慧对塑造中华民族精神的作用；联系日常生活，思考这些经典对自己有哪些启示。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"背诵《〈论语〉十二章》和《大学之道》。拓展阅读《孟子·公孙丑上》“敢问夫子恶乎长……则不能也”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"喜怒哀乐之未发，谓之中；发而皆中节，谓之和。中也者，天下之大本也；\n\n和也者，天下之达道也。致中和，天地位焉，万物育焉。\n\n——《礼记·中庸》","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"博学之，审问之，慎思之，明辨之，笃行之。有弗学，学之弗能，弗措也；\n\n有弗问，问之弗知，弗措也；有弗思，思之弗得，弗措也；有弗辨，辨之弗明，\n\n弗措也；有弗行，行之弗笃，弗措也。人一能之，己百之；人十能之，己千之。\n\n——《礼记·中庸》","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《孟子·公孙丑上》（","type":"text"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","text":"《孟子译注》","type":"link"},{"text":"，中华书局2008 年版）题目是编者加的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"不忍人，即怜爱别人。忍人，狠心对待别人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","text":"《孟子译注》","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%ba%e7%9a%86%e6%9c%89%e4%b8%8d%e5%bf%8d%e4%ba%ba%e4%b9%8b%e5%bf%83%e5%ad%9f%e5%ad%90","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%ba%e7%9a%86%e6%9c%89%e4%b8%8d%e5%bf%8d%e4%ba%ba%e4%b9%8b%e5%bf%83%e5%ad%9f%e5%ad%90","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%ba%e7%9a%86%e6%9c%89%e4%b8%8d%e5%bf%8d%e4%ba%ba%e4%b9%8b%e5%bf%83%e5%ad%9f%e5%ad%90","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%80%B5","sourceUrl":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%80%B5","text":"怵","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":9963,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","postId":9963,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://pkuschool.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2022/pdf/398767/1660127280134-3c826b73-3c81-4306-b8b2-c69052f574eb.pdf","text":"《孟子译注》","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-9963-1","postId":9963,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-9963-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-9963-2","postId":9963,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-9963-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","hre